t)\nBACK ROW(l.to.r.):G.Biscoe(Manager),A.Fairclough(Reserve),R.Piotrowski,L.O'Hara,P.Morris, P.O'Connor.\nFRONT ROW(l.to.r.):G.W.Dance,J.Thresher,Gerry North(Captain),Geoff North,T.Hart.\nNote:L. Mann is absent--under escort back to the Palace!.","id":"B172-30","w":"December 1969"},{"f":"crops/B173/B173-p44-oconnor-mann-back-cover.jpg","c":"BACK COVER : (Photo: Ron Linstead)---PAT O'CONNOR (168) and LIONEL MANN (166) fight it out during the Mitcham '15'. Pat finished 14th and Lionel 19th.","id":"B173-91","w":"March 1970"},{"f":"crops/B176/B176-p02-oconnor-ohara-epsom10.jpg","c":"Pat O'Connor leads Laurie O'Hara by six inchen (at a guess) in the \"Epsom 10\"","id":"B176-02","w":"December 1970"},{"f":"crops/B177/B177-p16-road-race-runners.jpg","c":"The 5¾-miles championship field, still hunched after one mile. Front row: Pat O'Connor (12), Tony Fairclough (21), Peter Carton (19), Trevor Hart (23), and Lionel Mann (9). The three framed heads look like those of Chris Steer, John Thresher and Dereck Fernee.","id":"B177-34","w":"June 1971"},{"f":"crops/B178/B178-p32-oconnor-hart-handover.jpg","c":"Pat O'Connor hands over to Trevor Hart at the end of stage 9. in 3rd place.","id":"B178-72","w":"September 1972"},{"f":"crops/B190/B190-p38-oconnor-stow.jpg","c":"Top right: Pat O'Connor leads from John Stow after one mile.","id":"B190-82","w":"November 1975"},{"f":"crops/B191/B191-p01-cover-cross-country.jpg","c":"Front page: Pat O'Connor, currently enjoying his best cross country season, works his way through the field to become Belgrave's first scorer in the South of Thames Senior Race.","id":"B191-01","w":"March 1976"},{"f":"crops/B194/B194-p23-mann-oconnor-haig-relay.jpg","c":"Lionel Mann is sent on his way by Pat O'Connor in the Belgrave Relay","id":"B194-45","w":"April 1977"},{"f":"crops/B199/B199-p47-oconnor-laws.jpg","c":"Pat O'Connor's expression tells all. He hasn't seen the competition during his leg of the Southern Road Relay. Bill Laws smiles but he too is destined to run a lonely time trial.","id":"B199-123","w":"October 1979"},{"f":"crops/B202/B202-p21-pat-oconnor.jpg","c":"Left:  Pat O'Connor,  Right: Chas Walker - Surrey County Vet's Champions 1980/81.","id":"B202-58","w":"April 1981"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B168/B168-p19-oconnor-leads-5-75.jpg","caption":"Pat O'Connor leads from Alan Black, Dick Piotrowski and Roger Donnison","source":"B168-23","when":"December 1968"},"slarchive":"https://slarchive.org/#athlete/pat-oconnor","slRaces":46,"x":1,"share":{"d":"Pat O'Connor in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1967–1998: 372 mentions in 55 issues, 305 race results and 13 photographs.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B173/B173-p44-oconnor-mann-back-cover.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-pat-o-connor.html"},"legend":false}